              "help": {
                "markdown": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2021-20190](https://osv.dev/CVE-2021-20190)**.\n\n## [GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w](https://osv.dev/GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e A flaw was found in jackson-databind before 2.9.10.7 and 2.6.7.5. FasterXML mishandles the interaction between serialization gadgets and typing. The highest threat from this vulnerability is to data confidentiality and integrity as well as system availability.\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n---\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/gradle.lockfile | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.9.8 |\n\n## Remediation\n\nTo fix these vulnerabilities, update the vulnerabilities past the listed fixed versions below.\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.6.7.5, 2.9.10.7 |\n\nIf you believe these vulnerabilities do not affect your code and wish to ignore them, add them to the ignore list in an\n`osv-scanner.toml` file located in the same directory as the lockfile containing the vulnerable dependency.\n\nSee the format and more options in our documentation here: https://google.github.io/osv-scanner/configuration/\n\nAdd or append these values to the following config files to ignore this vulnerability:\n\n`/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/osv-scanner.toml`\n\n```\n[[IgnoredVulns]]\nid = \"CVE-2021-20190\"\nreason = \"Your reason for ignoring this vulnerability\"\n```\n",
                "text": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2021-20190](https://osv.dev/CVE-2021-20190)**.\n\n## [GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w](https://osv.dev/GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e A flaw was found in jackson-databind before 2.9.10.7 and 2.6.7.5. FasterXML mishandles the interaction between serialization gadgets and typing. The highest threat from this vulnerability is to data confidentiality and integrity as well as system availability.\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n---\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/gradle.lockfile | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.9.8 |\n\n## Remediation\n\nTo fix these vulnerabilities, update the vulnerabilities past the listed fixed versions below.\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GHSA-5949-rw7g-wx7w | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.6.7.5, 2.9.10.7 |\n\nIf you believe these vulnerabilities do not affect your code and wish to ignore them, add them to the ignore list in an\n`osv-scanner.toml` file located in the same directory as the lockfile containing the vulnerable dependency.\n\nSee the format and more options in our documentation here: https://google.github.io/osv-scanner/configuration/\n\nAdd or append these values to the following config files to ignore this vulnerability:\n\n`/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/osv-scanner.toml`\n\n```\n[[IgnoredVulns]]\nid = \"CVE-2021-20190\"\nreason = \"Your reason for ignoring this vulnerability\"\n```\n"
