              "fullDescription": {
                "markdown": "This project contains the general-purpose data-binding functionality and tree-model for Jackson Data Processor. FasterXML jackson-databind 2.x before 2.9.10.6 mishandles the interaction between serialization gadgets and typing, related to br.com.anteros.dbcp.AnterosDBCPDataSource (aka Anteros-DBCP).",
