                "markdown": "In FasterXML jackson-databind before 2.12.7.1 and in 2.13.x before 2.13.4, resource exhaustion can occur because of a lack of a check in BeanDeserializer._deserializeFromArray to prevent use of deeply nested arrays. This issue can only happen when the `UNWRAP_SINGLE_VALUE_ARRAYS` feature is explicitly enabled.",
                "text": "In FasterXML jackson-databind before 2.12.7.1 and in 2.13.x before 2.13.4, resource exhaustion can occur because of a lack of a check in BeanDeserializer._deserializeFromArray to prevent use of deeply nested arrays. This issue can only happen when the `UNWRAP_SINGLE_VALUE_ARRAYS` feature is explicitly enabled."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2022-42004](https://osv.dev/CVE-2022-42004)**.\n\n## [GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4](https://osv.dev/GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e In FasterXML jackson-databind before 2.12.7.1 and in 2.13.x before 2.13.4, resource exhaustion can occur because of a lack of a check in BeanDeserializer._deserializeFromArray to prevent use of deeply nested arrays. This issue can only happen when the `UNWRAP_SINGLE_VALUE_ARRAYS` feature is explicitly enabled.\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n---\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/gradle.lockfile | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.9.8 |\n\n## Remediation\n\nTo fix these vulnerabilities, update the vulnerabilities past the listed fixed versions below.\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4 | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.12.7.1, 2.13.4 |\n\nIf you believe these vulnerabilities do not affect your code and wish to ignore them, add them to the ignore list in an\n`osv-scanner.toml` file located in the same directory as the lockfile containing the vulnerable dependency.\n\nSee the format and more options in our documentation here: https://google.github.io/osv-scanner/configuration/\n\nAdd or append these values to the following config files to ignore this vulnerability:\n\n`/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/osv-scanner.toml`\n\n```\n[[IgnoredVulns]]\nid = \"CVE-2022-42004\"\nreason = \"Your reason for ignoring this vulnerability\"\n```\n",
                "text": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2022-42004](https://osv.dev/CVE-2022-42004)**.\n\n## [GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4](https://osv.dev/GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e In FasterXML jackson-databind before 2.12.7.1 and in 2.13.x before 2.13.4, resource exhaustion can occur because of a lack of a check in BeanDeserializer._deserializeFromArray to prevent use of deeply nested arrays. This issue can only happen when the `UNWRAP_SINGLE_VALUE_ARRAYS` feature is explicitly enabled.\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n---\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/gradle.lockfile | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.9.8 |\n\n## Remediation\n\nTo fix these vulnerabilities, update the vulnerabilities past the listed fixed versions below.\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GHSA-rgv9-q543-rqg4 | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.12.7.1, 2.13.4 |\n\nIf you believe these vulnerabilities do not affect your code and wish to ignore them, add them to the ignore list in an\n`osv-scanner.toml` file located in the same directory as the lockfile containing the vulnerable dependency.\n\nSee the format and more options in our documentation here: https://google.github.io/osv-scanner/configuration/\n\nAdd or append these values to the following config files to ignore this vulnerability:\n\n`/home/runner/work/assay/assay/target/fixtures/sample-repo/app/osv-scanner.toml`\n\n```\n[[IgnoredVulns]]\nid = \"CVE-2022-42004\"\nreason = \"Your reason for ignoring this vulnerability\"\n```\n"
